Third-party code
================

No third-party code is redistributed in this repository or its packages. The lab images build
LibOSDP (Apache-2.0, https://github.com/osdp-dev/libosdp) from source at image build time:
version 3.0.8 from PyPI (Dockerfile) and tag v2.4.0 from git for the opt-in vulnerable profile
(Dockerfile.vuln). Neither is vendored.
